  #### Examples:

  >>> # Stacking two ragged tensors.
  >>> t1 = tf.ragged.constant([[1, 2], [3, 4, 5]])
  >>> t2 = tf.ragged.constant([[6], [7, 8, 9]])
  >>> tf.ragged.stack([t1, t2], axis=0)
  <tf.RaggedTensor [[[1, 2], [3, 4, 5]], [[6], [7, 8, 9]]]>
